{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123672","id":4591644899,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEa7w4w","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123672","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123672.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123672.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123672","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123672/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123672/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123672/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/73cc6bb631028f3acd29a935d049a5233aa315a3","number":123672,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Clear joypad touchpad info after disconnecting","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes a bug where the joypad touchpad info doesn't get cleared after the joypad gets disconnected, which lead to bugs such as `Input.get_joy_num_touchpads()` returning `1` even if the joypad is disconnected or it doesn't have touchpads at all.\r\n\r\nHow to reproduce the bug on `master`:\r\n1. Connect a controller with a touchpad (DualShock 4/DualSense controllers), notice that `Input.get_joy_num_touchpads()` returns `1`\r\n2. Disconnect it, notice that `Input.get_joy_num_touchpads()` still returns `1` even though the controller is disconnected\r\n3. Connect a controller without a touchpad, notice that `Input.get_joy_num_touchpads()` still returns `1`\r\n\r\nI can confirm this change fixes the issue for me on Windows with my DualShock 4 controller.\r\n\r\n- The bug was originally reported in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/pull/1354\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nNo AI was used.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","